Package: shared-mime-info
Version: @DEB_SHARED_MIME_INFO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xdg/shared-mime-info
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libxml2
Description: Freedesktop MIME database
 Shared MIME type database and update-mime-database tool. Plasma and KService
 use this to resolve common MIME types such as text/html.
